WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.560 --> 00:00:04.770
What famous pop star is poised to play a DC
Comics icon?

00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:07.173
Which sidekick is waiting to star in his own
film?

00:00:07.173 --> 00:00:10.232
And is Henry Cavill still Superman?

00:00:10.232 --> 00:00:15.890
Here's everything we know about all the upcoming
DC films we can't wait to see.

00:00:16.890 --> 00:00:20.929
Dwayne "The Rock" Johnson has been keen to
play Shazam nemesis Black Adam on the big

00:00:20.929 --> 00:00:22.849
screen for years.

00:00:22.849 --> 00:00:27.560
But ever since a solo flick featuring the
anti-hero was officially confirmed in January

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:30.429
2017, details have been slight.

00:00:30.429 --> 00:00:36.020
That changed at the 2020 FanDome, when Mr.
Rock presented some short video clips featuring

00:00:36.020 --> 00:00:37.770
concept art for the film.

00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:42.530
The first clip revealed the film will stick
to the character's comic origins, from his

00:00:42.530 --> 00:00:47.440
beginnings as a slave to his rise as a powerful
and feared despot.

00:00:47.440 --> 00:00:52.590
But it was the second clip that got fans buzzing
with the revelation that the movie will introduce

00:00:52.590 --> 00:00:55.350
the Justice Society of America to the DCEU.

00:00:55.350 --> 00:01:01.130
The team, which includes Hawkman, Doctor Fate,
Cyclone, and Atom Smasher, seem intent on

00:01:01.130 --> 00:01:06.049
helping Adam achieve his goals, but does the
anti-hero even want their help?

00:01:06.049 --> 00:01:11.070
Former James Bond actor Pierce Brosnan will
be playing Doctor Fate while Noah Centineo,

00:01:11.070 --> 00:01:15.850
best known for starring in To All the Boys
I've Loved Before, will portray Atom Smasher.

00:01:15.850 --> 00:01:21.380
Aldis Hodge of One Night in Miami will be
Hawkman and Quintessa Swindell of Trinkets

00:01:21.380 --> 00:01:23.249
will appear as Cyclone.

00:01:23.249 --> 00:01:27.920
13-year-old Bodhi Sabongui will also show
up in an unknown role while Uli Latukefu of

00:01:27.920 --> 00:01:30.420
Young Rock will also play an important part.

00:01:31.190 --> 00:01:36.899
After becoming a superhero in his 2019 film,
young Billy Batson will be taking on some

00:01:36.899 --> 00:01:41.000
new bad guys in the sequel, Shazam: Fury of
the Gods.

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:45.009
This time, though, he'll get a little help
from his foster family whom he transformed

00:01:45.009 --> 00:01:50.340
into Shazam-like heroes in the first movie
to defeat the evil Doctor Sivana.

00:01:50.340 --> 00:01:55.200
That movie's mid-credits scene revealed Sivana
is considering a team-up with Mister Mind,

00:01:55.200 --> 00:01:57.529
a space worm from the planet Venus.

00:01:57.529 --> 00:02:01.639
We also know that actress Helen Mirren is
joining the cast as a villainous character

00:02:01.639 --> 00:02:04.189
named Hespera, the daughter of Atlas.

00:02:04.189 --> 00:02:07.740
Lucy Liu will also be showing up as Hespera's
sister, Kalypso.

00:02:07.740 --> 00:02:12.290
In addition, Rachel Zegler will be menacing
the Shazam Family as yet another daughter

00:02:12.290 --> 00:02:13.340
of Atlas.

00:02:13.340 --> 00:02:14.340
Shazam!

00:02:14.340 --> 00:02:19.150
was a lot of fun, but we all know superhero
sequels tend to go darker.

00:02:19.150 --> 00:02:24.290
It stands to reason, then, that whatever Hespera's
evil plan is, young Billy is going to have

00:02:24.290 --> 00:02:26.379
some growing up to do in Shazam 2.

00:02:26.802 --> 00:02:32.209
Aquaman has been the butt of jokes for decades
thanks to his seemingly lame power set.

00:02:32.209 --> 00:02:35.310
The very idea of an Aquaman movie used to
be played for laughs.

00:02:35.310 --> 00:02:38.113
"You treat me like I'm not even on the team!

00:02:38.113 --> 00:02:41.743
Every day it's 'Aqua-loser this' and 'Aqua-pus
that'!"

00:02:41.743 --> 00:02:44.700
But then a funny thing happened.

00:02:44.700 --> 00:02:51.680
James Wan's Aquaman raked in over a billion
dollars worldwide and became the highest-grossing

00:02:51.680 --> 00:02:55.520
DCEU film, causing Warner Bros to greenlight
a sequel.

00:02:55.520 --> 00:02:59.760
Aquaman and the Lost Kingdom will see Wan
returning as producer and director.

00:02:59.760 --> 00:03:05.140
Jason Momoa, Patrick Wilson, Nicole Kidman,
Amber Heard, Randall Park, and Yahya Abdul-Mateen

00:03:05.140 --> 00:03:07.739
II will also all be back.

00:03:07.739 --> 00:03:14.010
New characters will be played by Pilou Asbæk,
Jani Zhao, and Vincent Regan, along with Indya

00:03:14.010 --> 00:03:17.250
Moore who will be portraying a telepathic
shark.

00:03:17.250 --> 00:03:21.870
Interestingly, the Lost Kingdom in the title
may refer to Necrus, a teleporting underwater

00:03:21.870 --> 00:03:25.680
city from the comics that's ruled by the tyrant
king Mongo.

00:03:25.680 --> 00:03:27.620
Could that be who Asbæk is playing?

00:03:27.620 --> 00:03:32.948
We'll find out when the film splashes down
in theaters on December 25, 2023.

00:03:32.948 --> 00:03:38.209
The long-awaited solo film for Ezra Miller's
Flash has been cooking since long before the

00:03:38.209 --> 00:03:42.010
character's cameo appearance in Batman v Superman:
Dawn of Justice.

00:03:42.010 --> 00:03:46.430
While Miller's multiple legal problems have
placed the film in jeopardy, test screenings

00:03:46.430 --> 00:03:47.430
have been positive.

00:03:47.430 --> 00:03:53.159
In fact, The Flash may end up accomplishing
the seemingly impossible feat of uniting every

00:03:53.159 --> 00:03:56.049
DC property into a single multiverse.

00:03:56.049 --> 00:04:00.920
Taking narrative cues from DC's iconic Flashpoint
storyline, Miller's Scarlet Speedster will

00:04:00.920 --> 00:04:04.840
be racing through different realities, sparking
crazy crossovers.

00:04:04.840 --> 00:04:10.069
Ben Affleck will reprise his role as Batman,
but Michael Keaton will also reprise his version

00:04:10.069 --> 00:04:13.160
of the Dark Knight we saw in 1989's Batman.

00:04:13.160 --> 00:04:18.100
One of those Waynes will even design a brand
new streamlined suit for the Flash.

00:04:18.100 --> 00:04:23.190
The first teaser showed what appears to be
Keaton's Batmobile and a look at two Barry

00:04:23.190 --> 00:04:27.100
Allens one of whom could be the Reverse Flash.

00:04:27.100 --> 00:04:32.389
Sasha Calle, who's set to star in a standalone
Supergirl film, also appeared in the teaser,

00:04:32.389 --> 00:04:35.230
standing alongside the two Barrys in her full
suit.

00:04:35.230 --> 00:04:40.050
We've also learned actor Ron Livingston will
replace Billy Crudup as Henry Allen due to

00:04:40.050 --> 00:04:41.449
scheduling conflicts.

00:04:41.679 --> 00:04:46.240
The Blue Beetle name has been taken up by
a few different characters in the comics,

00:04:46.240 --> 00:04:51.270
but the upcoming Blue Beetle film will focus
on the most recent: Jaime Reyes.

00:04:51.270 --> 00:04:55.840
In the comics, Reyes discovers the Blue Beetle
Scarab by accident and takes it home.

00:04:55.840 --> 00:05:01.360
The artifact swiftly bonds with him and grants
him an extraterrestrial suit of armor and

00:05:01.360 --> 00:05:03.860
a slew of powers to go with it.

00:05:03.860 --> 00:05:08.509
He's been part of several superhero groups
in the DC Universe, so a Blue Beetle film

00:05:08.509 --> 00:05:10.860
could play into several different IPs.

00:05:10.860 --> 00:05:16.220
Xolo Mariduena — Miguel Diaz on Cobra Kai
— will star as the titular superhero.

00:05:16.220 --> 00:05:22.700
He'll be joined by Bruna Marquezine as Jaime's
girlfriend Penny and Belissa Escobedo as his sister.

00:05:22.700 --> 00:05:27.849
George Lopez will star as Uncle Rudy while
Susan Sarandon will play Victoria Kord, a

00:05:27.849 --> 00:05:29.750
character created specifically for the film.

00:05:29.750 --> 00:05:36.550
Harvey Guillén has an undisclosed role while
Raoul Max Trujillo will play Carapax the Indestructible

00:05:36.550 --> 00:05:39.270
Man, a villain housed in a robotic body.

00:05:39.270 --> 00:05:43.680
Gareth Dunnet-Alcocer, who wrote the crime
thriller Miss Bala, will pen the screenplay,

00:05:43.680 --> 00:05:47.860
and Angel Manuel Soto will direct, following
his work on Charm City Kings.

00:05:47.860 --> 00:05:52.194
Blue Beetle is currently set to hit theaters
on August 18, 2023.

00:05:52.366 --> 00:05:57.930
Inspired by the history of Batman's greatest
foe, director and co-writer Todd Phillips

00:05:57.930 --> 00:06:03.950
reimagined the Joker as Arthur Fleck, a struggling
comedian suffering an emotional breakdown.

00:06:03.950 --> 00:06:10.280
As Joker earned multiple Academy Award nominations
and generated more than $1 billion in ticket

00:06:10.280 --> 00:06:13.030
sales, a sequel was bound to happen.

00:06:13.030 --> 00:06:18.320
Days after Joker opened, Phillips discussed
future DC Comics-based films with Warner Bros.

00:06:18.320 --> 00:06:19.949
chairman Toby Emmerich.

00:06:19.949 --> 00:06:25.229
In June 2022, Phillips posted a photo of a
script cover page on his Instagram account,

00:06:25.229 --> 00:06:27.770
bearing the title Joker: Folie à Deux.

00:06:27.770 --> 00:06:31.330
We can also expect to see Joaquin Phoenix
back in the title role when the film comes

00:06:31.330 --> 00:06:34.290
out on October 4, 2024.

00:06:34.290 --> 00:06:39.460
But he won't be alone, as the one and only
Lady Gaga will be playing Harley Quinn.

00:06:39.460 --> 00:06:44.517
Apparently, she'll get to sing too, as the
film is reportedly going to be a musical.

00:06:44.517 --> 00:06:49.830
The Green Lantern Corps movie has been a long
time coming, and there may still be a long

00:06:49.830 --> 00:06:50.830
road ahead.

00:06:50.830 --> 00:06:55.629
Both The Dark Knight screenwriter David Goyer
and Terminator: Dark Fate's Justin Rhodes

00:06:55.629 --> 00:06:57.680
have been attached to the project.

00:06:57.680 --> 00:07:03.819
Comics legend Geoff Johns has been rewriting
the script since 2019, and while his work

00:07:03.819 --> 00:07:06.949
continues, there may be a slight complication.

00:07:06.949 --> 00:07:11.879
Johns is also slated to contribute to showrunner
Greg Berlanti's Green Lantern series, which

00:07:11.879 --> 00:07:15.039
is in the works for the HBO Max streaming
service.

00:07:15.039 --> 00:07:18.630
While there's no word on whether the show
will connect to the Green Lantern Corps movie

00:07:18.630 --> 00:07:22.129
in any way, it sure seems like that would
make sense.

00:07:22.129 --> 00:07:26.740
At the moment, no character or plot details
have been made available for either the series

00:07:26.740 --> 00:07:27.423
or movie.

00:07:27.423 --> 00:07:31.889
Johns was to have delivered the first draft
of his script to Warner Bros. by the end of

00:07:31.889 --> 00:07:35.280
2019, so there may be some forward movement
on it soon.

00:07:35.280 --> 00:07:36.810
It's even been posited that J.J.

00:07:36.810 --> 00:07:40.910
Abrams and his Bad Robot production company
might get involved with the film.

00:07:40.910 --> 00:07:45.560
It's worth noting, though, that no Green Lantern
projects were announced in the initial unveiling

00:07:45.560 --> 00:07:46.660
of the partnership.

00:07:46.660 --> 00:07:51.383
For the time being, we'll just have to wait
to see how the long-awaited project shapes up.

00:07:51.383 --> 00:07:58.470
Perhaps no piece of superhero news has rocked
the world of cinema like the rumors that Henry

00:07:58.470 --> 00:08:00.930
Cavill will be stepping down as Superman.

00:08:00.930 --> 00:08:06.060
In September 2018, news leaked that negotiations
between Cavill and Warner Bros. had broken

00:08:06.060 --> 00:08:11.069
down over a cameo in Shazam!, leading to the
actor removing himself from the role.

00:08:11.069 --> 00:08:15.740
Since then, Warner Bros. and Cavill's own
rep have insisted Cavill is still employed,

00:08:15.740 --> 00:08:21.100
though the star himself has played it coy,
with a bizarre Instagram video being his only

00:08:21.100 --> 00:08:23.530
public response to the situation.

00:08:23.530 --> 00:08:28.060
While a script for Man of Steel 2 has been
confirmed to be in the works, there's no telling

00:08:28.060 --> 00:08:32.370
how this potentially massive shakeup will
affect the film's progress.

00:08:32.370 --> 00:08:37.160
Finding the perfect Superman is no small feat,
and it's hard to imagine the studio moving

00:08:37.160 --> 00:08:40.669
forward with this one if Cavill really needs
replacing.

00:08:40.669 --> 00:08:43.044
"I WILL FIND HIM!"

00:08:43.440 --> 00:08:48.190
If Henry Cavill does get replaced as the Man
of Steel, stories surrounding a new Superman

00:08:48.190 --> 00:08:53.720
film suggest DC is taking the superhero in
a vastly different direction.

00:08:53.720 --> 00:08:58.640
Ta-Nehisi Coates, known for his social journalism
and runs on the Black Panther and Captain

00:08:58.640 --> 00:09:00.680
America comics, is penning the script.

00:09:00.680 --> 00:09:05.910
J.J. Abrams and his production company Bad Robot
are attached to the film, but Abrams isn't

00:09:05.910 --> 00:09:07.300
in the running to direct.

00:09:07.300 --> 00:09:12.640
Instead, DC and Warner Bros. are looking for
a Black director and a Black lead actor.

00:09:12.640 --> 00:09:16.459
Rumored directors include Shaka King, Stephen
Caple Jr., J.D.

00:09:16.459 --> 00:09:19.510
Dillard, Regina King, Ryan Coogler, and more.

00:09:19.510 --> 00:09:23.680
Actor Michael B. Jordan has already responded
to rumors that he'll be donning the cape,

00:09:23.680 --> 00:09:27.630
saying he'd be flattered but was "just watching
on this one."

00:09:27.630 --> 00:09:32.950
As far as the film's plot, The Hollywood Reporter
reports that it might be a "20th-century period

00:09:32.950 --> 00:09:38.912
piece," and that Coates' version of Superman
is "a Kal-El in the vein of the original Superman comics."

00:09:38.912 --> 00:09:45.706
Finally, it's reported that this film will
be its own thing and not part of the existing

00:09:45.706 --> 00:09:51.360
Obviously, these are early days, and there's
a lot of speculation at this point, but keep

00:09:51.360 --> 00:09:55.424
your eyes peeled for more on this new version
of Supes.

00:09:55.424 --> 00:10:00.510
The HBO Max series Titans has already shown
the transformation of Batman's former sidekick

00:10:00.510 --> 00:10:04.529
Robin, played by Brenton Thwaites, into the
hero known as Nightwing.

00:10:04.529 --> 00:10:09.000
And it's this version of the character who
has long been rumored to be getting the feature

00:10:09.000 --> 00:10:10.180
film treatment.

00:10:10.180 --> 00:10:15.060
The project was first announced in early 2017,
with The Lego Batman Movie director Chris

00:10:15.060 --> 00:10:18.360
McKay slated to helm from a script by Bill
Dubuque.

00:10:18.360 --> 00:10:23.070
Since then, however, there has been complete
radio silence from Warner Bros. McKay offered

00:10:23.070 --> 00:10:28.050
a glimmer of hope for Nightwing in late 2018,
when he was asked directly whether the feature

00:10:28.050 --> 00:10:30.100
was dead and replied on Twitter:

00:10:30.100 --> 00:10:31.100
"No.

00:10:31.100 --> 00:10:32.970
You're going to have to wait tho.

00:10:32.970 --> 00:10:33.970
Keep hope alive.

00:10:33.970 --> 00:10:36.959
To paraphrase Dick Grayson: Nightwing lives.

00:10:36.959 --> 00:10:37.959
Always."

00:10:37.959 --> 00:10:41.290
McKay continues to express hope that the film
will make it to production.

00:10:41.290 --> 00:10:45.630
He hinted that Nightwing could be set in an
alternate universe or that it might see release

00:10:45.630 --> 00:10:49.880
outside of a standard theatrical one —maybe
going directly to HBO Max.

00:10:49.880 --> 00:10:54.260
Warner Bros. has already shelved its completed
Batgirl movie, but we'll be waiting with bated

00:10:54.260 --> 00:10:58.070
breath to see whether Dick Grayson's solo
vehicle actually makes it to production.

00:10:58.070 --> 00:10:59.769
"You've trained me well, Batman.

00:10:59.769 --> 00:11:02.670
But from now on, I make my own decisions.

00:11:02.670 --> 00:11:03.830
Call my own shots!"

00:11:04.359 --> 00:11:08.720
The idea of a feature film based on the alien bounty hunter Lobo has been kicking around 

00:11:08.720 --> 00:11:13.430
since before the DCEU with a canceled Guy
Ritchie-directed version discussed as far

00:11:13.430 --> 00:11:15.180
back as 2009.

00:11:15.180 --> 00:11:20.380
The project was revived as part of the DCEU
slate in 2016, with San Andreas director Brad

00:11:20.380 --> 00:11:23.160
Peyton set to helm with a script by Jason
Fuchs.

00:11:23.160 --> 00:11:28.790
In early 2018, none other than Michael Bay
was rumored to be taking the reins, with Fuchs

00:11:28.790 --> 00:11:31.260
still reported to be working on the script.

00:11:31.260 --> 00:11:35.740
As is becoming a theme with the DCEU, however,
the television side of things has threatened

00:11:35.740 --> 00:11:36.740
to intervene.

00:11:36.740 --> 00:11:42.010
The second season of the Syfy series Krypton
features Irish actor Emmett J. Scanlan as

00:11:42.010 --> 00:11:46.430
Lobo, leading some to speculate the character's
feature film prospects had dimmed.

00:11:46.430 --> 00:11:51.410
Still, there's been no official word from
Warner Bros., so a starring vehicle for the

00:11:51.410 --> 00:11:54.980
ultra-violent baddie could still be in the
cards.

00:11:54.980 --> 00:12:00.110
Once again, the name of the game is "wait
and see," but if there's one thing we know

00:12:00.110 --> 00:12:02.695
about Lobo, it's that he never quits.

00:12:02.695 --> 00:12:04.230
"It might take me a week.

00:12:04.230 --> 00:12:06.029
It might take me 10 years.

00:12:06.029 --> 00:12:08.490
But I'm gonna bust out."

00:12:08.490 --> 00:12:13.829
DC nabbed an Oscar winner for their planned
Blackhawk film.

00:12:13.829 --> 00:12:18.730
Steven Spielberg, who has taken home three
Academy Awards, will produce and likely direct

00:12:18.730 --> 00:12:23.320
a film based on Blackhawk, the leader of an
international squadron of pilots who take

00:12:23.320 --> 00:12:25.340
on the Nazis during World War II.

00:12:25.340 --> 00:12:30.510
The Blackhawk character debuted in 1941's
"Military Comics" #1 and was originally published

00:12:30.510 --> 00:12:34.470
by Quality Comics before DC acquired it in
1956.

00:12:34.470 --> 00:12:39.730
The character, who was co-created by Will
Eisner, Bob Powell, and Chuck Cuidera, headlined

00:12:39.730 --> 00:12:42.779
a number of best-selling comics in the 1940s.

00:12:42.779 --> 00:12:47.610
His World War II background makes him a great
fit for Spielberg, who earned an Oscar for

00:12:47.610 --> 00:12:50.660
directing the World War II drama Saving Private
Ryan.

00:12:50.660 --> 00:12:54.730
Spielberg is bringing on Indiana Jones and
the Crystal Skull and Jurassic Park writer

00:12:54.730 --> 00:12:56.959
David Koepp to pen the script.

00:12:56.959 --> 00:13:01.891
In 2022, four years after the project got
underway, Koepp told Collider that while a

00:13:01.891 --> 00:13:06.230
script is written, Warner Bros. has yet to
give the Blackhawk production a green light.

00:13:06.230 --> 00:13:07.440
According to the screenwriter:

00:13:07.440 --> 00:13:12.459
"There were a lot of management changes at
Warner Bros., so I think we've just been kind

00:13:12.459 --> 00:13:16.829
of waiting for that to settle down and for
them to decide what they want to do with their

00:13:16.829 --> 00:13:17.940
DC Universe."

00:13:18.242 --> 00:13:23.779
The DCEU's current version of Superman may
be up in the air, but one project Warner Bros.

00:13:23.779 --> 00:13:29.390
is reportedly high on is a starring cinematic
vehicle for his cousin Supergirl.

00:13:29.390 --> 00:13:34.550
The character is already enjoying a high profile
thanks to the success of her CW TV series,

00:13:34.550 --> 00:13:39.759
and the time seems right for the DCEU to introduce
another powerful female lead.

00:13:39.759 --> 00:13:45.440
Actress Sasha Calle, who beat out hundreds
of other auditioners, will be DCEU's Supergirl.

00:13:45.440 --> 00:13:50.300
Calle's only major role to date is on The
Young and the Restless, but she'll make her

00:13:50.300 --> 00:13:55.430
debut as Kara Zor-El in The Flash before taking
to the skies in Supergirl.

00:13:55.430 --> 00:13:59.720
Little is known about this in-development
project other than its screenwriter, Oren

00:13:59.720 --> 00:14:02.540
Uziel, who penned The Cloverfield Paradox.

00:14:02.540 --> 00:14:07.889
The rumor mill has suggested the project could
be set in the 1970s, in an alternate timeline

00:14:07.889 --> 00:14:11.190
where Kara arrives on Earth before her cousin.

00:14:11.190 --> 00:14:15.250
This would set the film version of the character
apart from her TV incarnation.

00:14:15.250 --> 00:14:22.267
Uziel has been at work on the script since
August 2018, so more details are sure to surface.

00:14:22.377 --> 00:14:26.700
DC is looking to bring a little magic into
its cinematic universe.

00:14:26.700 --> 00:14:32.749
The studio is aiming to put Zatanna Zatara,
a powerful magic-user, into her own feature film.

00:14:32.749 --> 00:14:37.260
Considering some of the other projects being
floated around the DC Universe, such as Justice

00:14:37.260 --> 00:14:42.079
League Dark, Zatanna's debut fits perfectly
into DC's current plans.

00:14:42.079 --> 00:14:47.199
The project is very early in development,
but one important detail has been confirmed.

00:14:47.199 --> 00:14:52.940
Emerald Fennell, writer of the Academy Award-nominated
film Promising Young Woman, has been tapped

00:14:52.940 --> 00:14:54.350
to write the screenplay.

00:14:54.350 --> 00:14:58.160
In an interview with Empire, Fennell said
she's excited for the scale Zatanna gives

00:14:58.160 --> 00:15:04.600
her to work with, and she can't wait to write
something "quite dark" that's also "big and scary."

00:15:04.600 --> 00:15:07.779
Since it's still so early, we don't have any
casting information yet.

00:15:07.779 --> 00:15:12.100
Serinda Swan played Zatanna in the CW show
Smallville, but since that series wrapped

00:15:12.100 --> 00:15:17.100
up over a decade ago, it seems unlikely she
would be cast as the lead of the new film.

00:15:17.100 --> 00:15:21.940
Birds of Prey introduced us to quite the crew
of DC antiheroes.

00:15:21.940 --> 00:15:26.680
Though it mainly gave Margot Robbie's Harley
Quinn a chance to fly solo, it also introduced

00:15:26.680 --> 00:15:32.100
us to updated takes on Black Mask, Huntress,
Victor Zsasz, and Black Canary.

00:15:32.100 --> 00:15:37.690
That last one apparently made a good impression
as actor Jurnee Smollett has been tapped to

00:15:37.690 --> 00:15:40.292
reprise the role in her own solo film.

00:15:40.292 --> 00:15:42.227
"Wanna hear a secret?"

00:15:45.259 --> 00:15:49.610
While still very early in development, we
do have an idea who's going to help bring

00:15:49.610 --> 00:15:51.459
a Black Canary movie to life.

00:15:51.459 --> 00:15:55.790
Smollett will be reuniting with Lovecraft
Country creator Misha Green, who's penning

00:15:55.790 --> 00:15:56.790
the script.

00:15:56.790 --> 00:15:59.940
Black Canary is also being produced by Sue
Kroll of Kroll &amp; Co.

00:15:59.940 --> 00:16:02.500
Entertainment, who also produced Birds of
Prey.

00:16:02.500 --> 00:16:06.860
The film is in development for an HBO Max
release, suggesting it'll be smaller in scale

00:16:06.860 --> 00:16:10.588
than the "pillar" DCEU movies involving the
Justice League.

00:16:10.746 --> 00:16:16.399
Fans of early 2000s animation might remember
the Static Shock series, which aired on Kids'

00:16:16.399 --> 00:16:18.550
WB for four seasons.

00:16:18.550 --> 00:16:23.450
Based on the Milestone Comics character, Virgil
Hawkins is a 14-year-old boy who gains electrical

00:16:23.450 --> 00:16:28.529
and magnetic powers after a freak accident
and becomes the superhero Static.

00:16:28.529 --> 00:16:33.990
During the 2021 FanDome event, a Static Shock
movie was confirmed to be in development with

00:16:33.990 --> 00:16:35.779
Randy McKinnon penning the script.

00:16:35.779 --> 00:16:40.860
Reginald Hudlin, who's overseeing the relaunch
of Milestone Comics, is also working behind

00:16:40.860 --> 00:16:41.860
the scenes.

00:16:41.860 --> 00:16:45.620
In addition, Michael B. Jordan's production
company Outlier Society is helping to bring

00:16:45.620 --> 00:16:46.670
the film to life.

00:16:46.670 --> 00:16:49.459
In October 2020, Jordan told The Hollywood
Reporter:

00:16:49.459 --> 00:16:54.459
"I'm proud to be a part of building a new
universe centered around black superheroes;

00:16:54.459 --> 00:16:56.459
our community deserves that.

00:16:56.459 --> 00:17:00.940
Outlier Society is committed to bringing to
life diverse comic book content across all

00:17:00.940 --> 00:17:06.766
platforms, and we are excited to partner with
Reggie and Warner Bros on this initial step."

00:17:06.899 --> 00:17:12.160
DC is starting to dig deeper into their bag
of tricks for characters they want to build

00:17:12.160 --> 00:17:16.740
films around, and their latest offbeat choice
is Hourman.

00:17:16.740 --> 00:17:20.310
There have been multiple characters who've
taken up that mantle, but they all center

00:17:20.310 --> 00:17:25.550
around a chemical formula that grants the
user incredible abilities for one hour.

00:17:25.550 --> 00:17:29.260
We've actually seen several versions of Hourman
in the CW's Arrowverse.

00:17:29.260 --> 00:17:34.240
Patrick J. Adams played Rex Tyler, the original
Hourman, on Legends of Tomorrow while Lou

00:17:34.240 --> 00:17:37.120
Ferrigno Jr. played the character on Stargirl.

00:17:37.120 --> 00:17:43.020
Cameron Gellman played Rex's son Rick Tyler
on Stargirl and took on the Hourman mantle himself.

00:17:43.020 --> 00:17:47.360
However, it remains to be seen what direction
DC will go with the Hourman film.

00:17:47.360 --> 00:17:50.870
The screenplay is being tackled by Gavin James
and Neil Widener.

00:17:50.870 --> 00:17:55.690
Chernin Entertainment, which also developed
the most recent Planet of the Apes franchise,

00:17:55.690 --> 00:17:59.663
is producing the film alongside DC and Warner
Bros.

00:17:59.663 --> 00:18:04.960
Wonder Woman is regarded as one of the DCEU's
best efforts and director Patty Jenkins says

00:18:04.960 --> 00:18:09.170
there are plenty more stories to tell about
Diana's Amazon sisters.

00:18:09.170 --> 00:18:13.770
DC is currently working on a spinoff about
these warrior women, and while the details

00:18:13.770 --> 00:18:19.760
are scarce, Jenkins has said the spinoff will
focus on events that occur after Diana leaves Themyscira.

00:18:19.760 --> 00:18:24.570
She also said the story would help bridge
the gap between Wonder Woman 1984 and Diana's

00:18:24.570 --> 00:18:25.690
third film.

00:18:25.690 --> 00:18:30.390
That seems to indicate that the spinoff will
be released before the in-development Wonder

00:18:30.390 --> 00:18:31.400
Woman 3.

00:18:31.400 --> 00:18:35.220
Jenkins will not be directing this spinoff,
but she is involved in the film's creative

00:18:35.220 --> 00:18:36.830
development as a producer.

00:18:36.830 --> 00:18:42.098
We expect other Amazons to reappear, but details
remain tightly wrapped up at this point.

00:18:42.098 --> 00:18:48.090
Unlike Wonder Woman 1984's HBO Max release,
Wonder Woman 3 will have a traditional theatrical

00:18:48.090 --> 00:18:51.840
release and is expected to be a concluding
film to the trilogy.

00:18:51.840 --> 00:18:56.430
During 2021's FanDome, writer-director Patty
Jenkins also revealed that original Wonder

00:18:56.430 --> 00:19:01.090
Woman Lynda Carter will be returning as Amazonian
warrior Asteria.

00:19:01.090 --> 00:19:06.770
That said, it could still be a long while
before we get to finish the story of Diana Prince.

00:19:06.770 --> 00:19:11.920
Jenkins and star Gal Gadot are working together
on the historical drama Cleopatra, and Jenkins

00:19:11.920 --> 00:19:16.350
has been tapped to direct Star Wars: Rogue
Squadron, which is scheduled to come out in

00:19:16.350 --> 00:19:17.860
Christmas 2023.

00:19:17.860 --> 00:19:21.990
Gadot is attached to about a half-dozen other
projects, as well.

00:19:21.990 --> 00:19:27.110
In other words, it's going to be a while,
but we'll eventually get to see another Wonder

00:19:27.110 --> 00:19:28.981
Woman movie on the big screen.

